     ],
     "id": "bc7c1f63-778e-4ec7-8091-bbbfdbce8cfb"
    },
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"375116\" data-output-id=\"194\" data-out-n=\"1115\" data-sub-idx=\"6\" data-output-format=\"SVG\" data-output-is-graphics=\"1\" data-cell-idx=\"12\" data-sub-start=\"14\" data-sub-end=\"14\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[1115]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><span class=\"vscode-wolfram-gfx-marker\" style=\"display:none;\"></span><img class=\"vscode-wolfram-svg-output\" data-wl-img=\"c:\\Users\\bobla\\Documents\\DCT\\img\\EAB_DCT_analysis\\wl_5dzxii1w75j3.svg\" src=\"img/EAB_DCT_analysis/wl_5dzxii1w75j3.svg\"/></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "(* output: graphics *)\n(* Kramers-Kronig-valid lower bound for every file, using the threshold from params *)\nkkMins = Map[First[DCTKKCheck`KKValidFreqRange[#, kkResidualThreshold]] &, kkAllResults];\n\n(* Percentile table — inspect before accepting the automatic fMinHz *)\nPrint[Style[\"Lin-KK fMin distribution (threshold = \" <> ToString[100 kkResidualThreshold] <> \"%):\", Bold, 13]];\nPrint[Grid[\n  Prepend[\n    {ToString[#] <> \"th\", NumberForm[Quantile[kkMins, #/100.], {5,3}]} & /@ {0, 25, 50, 75, 90, 95, 100},\n    {Style[\"Percentile\", Bold], Style[\"fMin (Hz)\", Bold]}\n  ],\n  Frame -> All, Alignment -> {Right, Center}, Spacings -> {2, 0.8}\n]];\n\n(* Histogram of the per-file valid lower bound — outliers show up as a long right tail *)\nDCTPlots`PlotKKFMinHistogram[kkMins]",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "e86c053f-5575-4c93-876b-22a8b4522fe2"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### 1.3 Set fMinHz",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* Set fMinHz from the population percentile defined in params.\n   If the histogram shows a long right tail (outlier files), lower kkFMinPercentile\n   or investigate those files individually. *)\nfMinHz = Quantile[kkMins, kkFMinPercentile / 100.];\nPrint[\"fMinHz \\[LeftArrow] \", NumberForm[fMinHz, {5,3}], \" Hz  \",\n      \"(\", kkFMinPercentile, \"th percentile of \", Length[kkMins], \" files)\"]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-print-output\"><div class=\"wl-print-line\"><span class=\"wl-ps\">fMinHz ← </span><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered wl-lb-pending\" data-lb-id=\"lb-mqwpj7cl-0k8svok\" data-page-width-em=\"36\" data-latex-b64=\"XHRleHR7Mi41MTJ9\" style=\"opacity:0.65;transition:opacity 0.35s\"><div class=\"wl-lb-content\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">2.512</span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div><span class=\"wl-ps\"> Hz  </span><span class=\"wl-ps\">(</span><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered wl-lb-pending\" data-lb-id=\"lb-mqwpj7cm-no8kibm\" data-page-width-em=\"36\" data-latex-b64=\"NTA=\" style=\"opacity:0.65;transition:opacity 0.35s\"><div class=\"wl-lb-content\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">50</span></span></span></span></span></div></div><span class=\"wl-ps\">th percentile of </span><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered wl-lb-pending\" data-lb-id=\"lb-mqwpj7cn-mfx1rcy\" data-page-width-em=\"36\" data-latex-b64=\"NDU4\" style=\"opacity:0.65;transition:opacity 0.35s\"><div class=\"wl-lb-content\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">458</span></span></span></span></span></div></div><span class=\"wl-ps\"> files)</span></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Print: fMinHz ←[formula] Hz([formula]th percentile of[formula] files)",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "c4899994-5a4f-4918-9080-e744b19342fc"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 2. Admittance Statistics\nCompute per-frequency mean and variance of |Y(f)| across all drift files (undecimated). CV plot flags unreliable frequencies; power-law scatter derives `weightPower`. Update the params cell with the suggested values before proceeding.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### 2.1 Compute statistics",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* Group files by electrode subdirectory, compute within-electrode variance stats,\n   then pool across electrodes for the power-law fit. Each electrode may have a\n   different absolute admittance level — pooling the (YMean, YVar) points across\n   all electrodes gives a better estimate of the noise scaling exponent alpha. *)\nelectrodeGroups = GroupBy[\n  sortFiles[FileNames[\"*.txt\", dataDir, Infinity]][[;; ;; debugDecimationFactor]],\n  FileNameTake[#, {-2}] &   (* second-to-last path component = electrode name *)\n];\nPrint[\"Electrodes: \", Row[Keys[electrodeGroups], \", \"],\n  \"   files: \", Row[Length /@ Values[electrodeGroups], \" / \"]];\n\nelectrodeStats = Association @ KeyValueMap[\n  #1 -> DCTAdmittanceStats`ComputeAdmittanceStats[#2] &,\n  electrodeGroups\n];\n\ndriftStats = DCTAdmittanceStats`MergeAdmittanceStats[Values[electrodeStats]];\nIf[FailureQ[driftStats],\n  Print[Style[\"Failed: \" <> driftStats[\"Message\"], Red, Bold]],\n  Print[Style[\n    \"Done: \" <> ToString[driftStats[\"FilesOK\"]] <> \" / \" <>\n    ToString[driftStats[\"FilesTotal\"]] <> \" files across \" <>\n    ToString[Length[electrodeGroups]] <> \" electrodes, \" <>\n    ToString[Length[driftStats[\"FreqHz\"]]] <> \" pooled (freq, electrode) points.\",\n    Bold, Darker[Green]\n  ]]\n]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-print-output\"><div class=\"wl-print-line\"><span class=\"wl-ps\">Electrodes: </span><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered wl-lb-pending\" data-lb-id=\"lb-mqwpj7dq-gvfm7bm\" data-page-width-em=\"36\" data-latex-b64=\"XHRleHR7RTF9XHRleHR7LCB9XHRleHR7RTJ9XHRleHR7LCB9XHRleHR7RTN9\" style=\"opacity:0.65;transition:opacity 0.35s\"><div class=\"wl-lb-content\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">E1</span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">, </span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">E2</span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">, </span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">E3</span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div><span class=\"wl-ps\">   files: </span><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered wl-lb-pending\" data-lb-id=\"lb-mqwpj7dr-6c0t8oa\" data-page-width-em=\"36\" data-latex-b64=\"MTU0XHRleHR7IC8gfTE1Mlx0ZXh0eyAvIH0xNTI=\" style=\"opacity:0.65;transition:opacity 0.35s\"><div class=\"wl-lb-content\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">154</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> / </span></span><span class=\"mord\">152</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> / </span></span><span class=\"mord\">152</span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Print: Electrodes:[formula]   files:[formula]",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "32e52335-25d6-4fc2-b8c5-7ae32d141d47"
    },
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-print-output\"><div class=\"wl-print-line\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered wl-lb-pending\" data-lb-id=\"lb-mqwpjcto-lz06nue\" data-page-width-em=\"36\" data-latex-b64=\"XG1hdGhiZntcdGV4dGNvbG9yeyMwMGZmMDB9e1x0ZXh0e0RvbmU6IDQ1OCAvIDQ1OCBmaWxlcyBhY3Jvc3MgMyBlbGVjdHJvZGVzLCAxNTMgcG9vbGVkIChmcmVxLCBlbGVjdHJvZGUpIHBvaW50cy59fX0=\" style=\"opacity:0.65;transition:opacity 0.35s\"><div class=\"wl-lb-content\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\" style=\"color:#00ff00;\"><span class=\"mord\" style=\"color:#00ff00;\">Done: 458 / 458 files across 3 electrodes, 153 pooled (freq, electrode) points.</span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Print: [formula]",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "a99fa9b8-df31-4a3d-98ab-eb1e49832f9c"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### 2.2 Variance vs mean",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* Var vs |Y_mean| scatter — power-law fit gives weightPower *)\nDCTPlots`PlotVariancePowerLaw[driftStats]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"375116\" data-output-id=\"195\" data-out-n=\"1123\" data-sub-idx=\"1\" data-output-format=\"SVG\" data-output-is-graphics=\"1\" data-cell-idx=\"19\" data-sub-start=\"1\" data-sub-end=\"1\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[1123]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><span class=\"vscode-wolfram-gfx-marker\" style=\"display:none;\"></span><img class=\"vscode-wolfram-svg-output\" data-wl-img=\"c:\\Users\\bobla\\Documents\\DCT\\img\\EAB_DCT_analysis\\wl_1nz3b23p3gmi9.svg\" src=\"img/EAB_DCT_analysis/wl_1nz3b23p3gmi9.svg\"/></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "(* output: graphics *)\n(* Var vs |Y_mean| scatter — power-law fit gives weightPower *)\nDCTPlots`PlotVariancePowerLaw[driftStats]",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "523d213d-f0bb-4c55-ab13-7a08f809c5e4"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### 2.3 Set fMaxHz",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* Above ~500 Hz the variance-vs-mean curve inflects away from the power law:\n   admittance is dominated by Rs / parasitic capacitance, not charge transfer.\n   DCT resolves nothing useful there — tighten the upper cutoff. *)\nfMaxHz = 500.;\nPrint[\"fMaxHz \\[LeftArrow] \", fMaxHz, \" Hz\"]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-print-output\"><div class=\"wl-print-line\"><span class=\"wl-ps\">fMaxHz ← </span><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered wl-lb-pending\" data-lb-id=\"lb-mqwpjd5p-spt5stl\" data-page-width-em=\"36\" data-latex-b64=\"NTAwLlws\" style=\"opacity:0.65;transition:opacity 0.35s\"><div class=\"wl-lb-content\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">500.</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span></span></span></span></span></div></div><span class=\"wl-ps\"> Hz</span></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Print: fMaxHz ←[formula] Hz",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "70f7fa01-02e8-42bd-a6fe-54e726b57bf0"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### 2.4 Variance overview",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* All data shown; power-law fit and annotation use only [fMinHz, fMaxHz].\n   Dashed vertical lines mark the fit boundaries. *)\nDCTPlots`PlotVariancePowerLaw[driftStats, fMinHz, fMaxHz]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"375116\" data-output-id=\"196\" data-out-n=\"1126\" data-sub-idx=\"1\" data-output-format=\"SVG\" data-output-is-graphics=\"1\" data-cell-idx=\"23\" data-sub-start=\"2\" data-sub-end=\"2\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[1126]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><span class=\"vscode-wolfram-gfx-marker\" style=\"display:none;\"></span><img class=\"vscode-wolfram-svg-output\" data-wl-img=\"c:\\Users\\bobla\\Documents\\DCT\\img\\EAB_DCT_analysis\\wl_19xyjkj0xffxb.svg\" src=\"img/EAB_DCT_analysis/wl_19xyjkj0xffxb.svg\"/></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "(* output: graphics *)\n(* All data shown; power-law fit and annotation use only [fMinHz, fMaxHz].\n   Dashed vertical lines mark the fit boundaries. *)\nDCTPlots`PlotVariancePowerLaw[driftStats, fMinHz, fMaxHz]",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "d117cb31-b91d-40ac-9719-4afaa419d289"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### 2.5 Parameter readout",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "fMinHz\r\nfMaxHz",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"375116\" data-output-id=\"197\" data-out-n=\"1127\" data-sub-idx=\"0\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"25\" data-sub-start=\"0\" data-sub-end=\"0\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[1127]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered wl-lb-pending\" data-lb-id=\"lb-mqwpjdlw-9moz759\" data-page-width-em=\"36\" data-latex-b64=\"Mi41MTE5\" style=\"opacity:0.65;transition:opacity 0.35s\"><div class=\"wl-lb-content\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2.5119</span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
