  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### 4a. Drift Plots\nRun each cell independently. `goodSpecs` must exist (run the fit cell above first).",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### 4a.1 g(k) by electrode",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* DCT spectrum — g(k) for E1 only, sorted by file number (= time order).\n   Inline 0 h -> 24 h drift arrow (right of the main peak) instead of a per-file\n   legend; theme-aware so it stays visible in dark and publication. y in nF/decade. *)\ne1Specs = SortBy[\n  Select[goodSpecs, FileNameTake[#[\"File\"], {-2}] === \"E1\" &],\n  Last[ToExpression /@ StringCases[FileNameTake[#[\"File\"]], NumberString], 0] &\n];\nDCTPlots`PlotGK[e1Specs, \"GScale\" -> 1*^9, PlotLegends -> None,\n  Epilog -> With[{fg = If[DCTPlots`$DCTTheme === \"Publication\", Black, White], c0 = ColorData[\"Rainbow\"][0.05], c24 = ColorData[\"Rainbow\"][0.95]},\n    {Style[Text[\"0 h\", Scaled[{0.6, 0.92}]], c0, 16, Bold],\n     {Gray, Arrowheads[0.022], AbsoluteThickness[1.1], Arrow[{Scaled[{0.6, 0.84}], Scaled[{0.6, 0.62}]}]},\n     Style[Text[\"24 h\", Scaled[{0.6, 0.54}]], c24, 16, Bold]}]]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"375116\" data-output-id=\"201\" data-out-n=\"1149\" data-sub-idx=\"2\" data-output-format=\"SVG\" data-output-is-graphics=\"1\" data-cell-idx=\"45\" data-sub-start=\"7\" data-sub-end=\"11\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[1149]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><span class=\"vscode-wolfram-gfx-marker\" style=\"display:none;\"></span><img class=\"vscode-wolfram-svg-output\" data-wl-img=\"c:\\Users\\bobla\\Documents\\DCT\\img\\EAB_DCT_analysis\\wl_1jscmj3rfgjwi.svg\" src=\"img/EAB_DCT_analysis/wl_1jscmj3rfgjwi.svg\"/></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "(* output: graphics *)\n(* DCT spectrum — g(k) for E1 only, sorted by file number (= time order).\n   Inline 0 h -> 24 h drift arrow (right of the main peak) instead of a per-file\n   legend; theme-aware so it stays visible in dark and publication. y in nF/decade. *)\ne1Specs = SortBy[\n  Select[goodSpecs, FileNameTake[#[\"File\"], {-2}] === \"E1\" &],\n  Last[ToExpression /@ StringCases[FileNameTake[#[\"File\"]], NumberString], 0] &\n];\nDCTPlots`PlotGK[e1Specs, \"GScale\" -> 1*^9, PlotLegends -> None,\n  Epilog -> With[{fg = If[DCTPlots`$DCTTheme === \"Publication\", Black, White], c0 = ColorData[\"Rainbow\"][0.05], c24 = ColorData[\"Rainbow\"][0.95]},\n    {Style[Text[\"0 h\", Scaled[{0.6, 0.92}]], c0, 16, Bold],\n     {Gray, Arrowheads[0.022], AbsoluteThickness[1.1], Arrow[{Scaled[{0.6, 0.84}], Scaled[{0.6, 0.62}]}]},\n     Style[Text[\"24 h\", Scaled[{0.6, 0.54}]], c24, 16, Bold]}]]",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "61b20fc0-b239-4f08-9b50-84df226ac5f3"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### 4a.2 Cumulative capacitance",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* Cumulative capacitance vs k *)\nDCTPlots`PlotCumulative[goodSpecs]",
