  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 5. Concentration Analysis\nSet `concentrationDir` in the params cell first. Uses the same locked parameters as the drift fit.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### 5.1 Batch concentration fit",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* Batch-fit concentration files from BOTH directories with the locked parameters.\n   The second directory's electrodes are renumbered +3 \\[Rule] E4, E5, E6, so the\n   two titrations combine into a single 6-electrode concGoodSpecs. *)\n\nconcElec[f_] := First[StringCases[FileNameTake[f], \"E\" ~~ d : DigitCharacter :> d], \"0\"];\nconcUM[f_]   := ToExpression @ First[StringCases[FileNameTake[f], n : NumberString ~~ \"uM\" :> n], \"0\"];\nconcLabelOff[f_, off_] := Module[{conc},\n  conc = First[StringCases[FileNameTake[f], n : NumberString ~~ \"uM\" :> n], \"?\"];\n  \"E\" <> ToString[ToExpression[concElec[f]] + off] <> \" \" <> conc <> \" \\[Mu]M\"\n];\n\nfitConcDir[dir_, off_] := If[!StringQ[dir] || dir === \"\" || !DirectoryQ[dir], {},\n  Module[{files},\n    files = SortBy[FileNames[\"*.txt\", dir], {concElec[#], concUM[#]} &];\n    Print[\"  \", FileNameTake[dir], \":  \", Length[files], \" files  (electrodes +\", off, \")\"];\n    Table[\n      Module[{spec},\n        spec = Quiet @ Check[\n          DCT`DCTSpectrum[files[[i]],\n            \"LambdaND\" -> lambdaND, \"FMinUse\" -> fMinHz, \"FMaxUse\" -> fMaxHz,\n            \"WeightPower\" -> weightPower, \"BinsPerDecade\" -> binsPerDecade,\n            \"TauMinFactor\" -> tauMinFactor, \"TauMaxFactor\" -> tauMaxFactor], $Failed];\n        <|\"File\" -> concLabelOff[files[[i]], off], \"Spec\" -> spec, \"OK\" -> AssociationQ[spec]|>\n      ],\n      {i, Length[files]}]\n  ]\n];\n\nPrint[\"Fitting concentration data (\", fMinHz, \" \\[Dash] \", fMaxHz, \" Hz):\"];\nconcResults    = Join[fitConcDir[concentrationDir, 0], fitConcDir[concentrationDir2, 3]];\nconcGoodSpecs  = Select[concResults, #OK === True &];\nconcElectrodes = Sort @ DeleteDuplicates[StringTake[#[\"File\"], 2] & /@ concGoodSpecs];\n\nPrint[Style[\n  ToString[Length[concGoodSpecs]] <> \" / \" <> ToString[Length[concResults]] <>\n  \" fits succeeded \\[Dash] electrodes \" <> StringRiffle[concElectrodes, \", \"] <> \".\",\n  Bold, Darker[Green]]]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-print-output\"><div class=\"wl-print-line\"><span class=\"wl-ps\">Fitting concentration data (</span><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered wl-lb-pending\" data-lb-id=\"lb-mqwpjvu2-zpo1zvn\" data-page-width-em=\"35\" data-latex-b64=\"Mi41MTE5\" style=\"opacity:0.65;transition:opacity 0.35s\"><div class=\"wl-lb-content\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2.5119</span></span></span></span></span></div></div><span class=\"wl-ps\"> – </span><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered wl-lb-pending\" data-lb-id=\"lb-mqwpjvu3-co5rh4y\" data-page-width-em=\"35\" data-latex-b64=\"NTAwLlws\" style=\"opacity:0.65;transition:opacity 0.35s\"><div class=\"wl-lb-content\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">500.</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span></span></span></span></span></div></div><span class=\"wl-ps\"> Hz):</span></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Print: Fitting concentration data ([formula] –[formula] Hz):",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "43e36620-6f40-4178-8316-d4942de714dc"
    },
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-print-output\"><div class=\"wl-print-line\"><span class=\"wl-ps\">  </span><span class=\"wl-ps\">spike</span><span class=\"wl-ps\">:  </span><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered wl-lb-pending\" data-lb-id=\"lb-mqwpjvua-zlgvvtm\" data-page-width-em=\"35\" data-latex-b64=\"MjQ=\" style=\"opacity:0.65;transition:opacity 0.35s\"><div class=\"wl-lb-content\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">24</span></span></span></span></span></div></div><span class=\"wl-ps\"> files  (electrodes +</span><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered wl-lb-pending\" data-lb-id=\"lb-mqwpjvub-h9ldtjf\" data-page-width-em=\"35\" data-latex-b64=\"MA==\" style=\"opacity:0.65;transition:opacity 0.35s\"><div class=\"wl-lb-content\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span></div></div><span class=\"wl-ps\">)</span></div></div><div class=\"wl-print-output\"><div class=\"wl-print-line\"><span class=\"wl-ps\">  </span><span class=\"wl-ps\">2026-02-25-titration</span><span class=\"wl-ps\">:  </span><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered wl-lb-pending\" data-lb-id=\"lb-mqwpjwh0-n1dli5t\" data-page-width-em=\"35\" data-latex-b64=\"MTU=\" style=\"opacity:0.65;transition:opacity 0.35s\"><div class=\"wl-lb-content\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">15</span></span></span></span></span></div></div><span class=\"wl-ps\"> files  (electrodes +</span><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered wl-lb-pending\" data-lb-id=\"lb-mqwpjwh1-ar26t0l\" data-page-width-em=\"35\" data-latex-b64=\"Mw==\" style=\"opacity:0.65;transition:opacity 0.35s\"><div class=\"wl-lb-content\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span></div></div><span class=\"wl-ps\">)</span></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
