  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### 5.2 g(k) spectra",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* Concentration g(k) spectra â one electrode *)\nconcE1 = Select[concGoodSpecs, StringStartsQ[#File, \"E1\"] &];\nDCTPlots`PlotGK[concE1]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"375116\" data-output-id=\"207\" data-out-n=\"1167\" data-sub-idx=\"2\" data-output-format=\"SVG\" data-output-is-graphics=\"1\" data-cell-idx=\"62\" data-sub-start=\"2\" data-sub-end=\"2\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[1167]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><span class=\"vscode-wolfram-gfx-marker\" style=\"display:none;\"></span><img class=\"vscode-wolfram-svg-output\" data-wl-img=\"c:\\Users\\bobla\\Documents\\DCT\\img\\EAB_DCT_analysis\\wl_eigj5l468n7u.svg\" src=\"img/EAB_DCT_analysis/wl_eigj5l468n7u.svg\"/></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "(* output: graphics *)\n(* Concentration g(k) spectra â one electrode *)\nconcE1 = Select[concGoodSpecs, StringStartsQ[#File, \"E1\"] &];\nDCTPlots`PlotGK[concE1]",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "d8a733ae-8062-4d1e-bf08-1502c6399e50"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### 5.3 Area-normalised g(k)",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* Concentration g(k), area-normalised (each curve / its integrated capacitance),\n   with per-curve leader-line labels instead of a legend: each label sits to the\n   right of the fast peak and a thin colour-matched line points to that curve's\n   fast (folded) peak. The normalised fast peak grows monotonically with\n   concentration, so labels run 1000 -> 0 top-to-bottom and the leaders don't cross. *)\nconcE1   = Select[concGoodSpecs, StringStartsQ[#File, \"E1\"] &];\nnC       = Length[concE1];\nconcCols = Table[ColorData[\"Rainbow\"][u], {u, 0.05, 0.95, 0.9/Max[nC - 1, 1]}];\nconcLbls = StringTrim[StringDrop[#File, 2]] & /@ concE1;   (* \"0 \\[Mu]M\", ... (drop the \"E1\") *)\ngNorm[sp_] := sp[\"g\"]/Max[DCTPeakAnalysis`IntegrateSpectrum[sp], 1.*^-15];\n\n(* anchor each leader to that curve's fast peak (k in [100, 300] /s) *)\nfastAnchor[sp_] := Module[{k = 1./sp[\"Tau\"], gN = gNorm[sp], idx},\n  idx = Select[Range[Length[gN]], 100 <= k[[#]] <= 300 &];\n  If[idx === {}, idx = Range[Length[gN]]];\n  {k[[idx[[First@Ordering[gN[[idx]], -1]]]]], Max[gN[[idx]]]}];\nconcAnchors = fastAnchor[#Spec] & /@ concE1;\n\nallK = Flatten[1./#Spec[\"Tau\"] & /@ concE1];\n{kLo, kHi} = MinMax[allK];\ngHi  = Max[Flatten[gNorm[#Spec] & /@ concE1]] 1.08;\nfX[k_] := (Log10[k] - Log10[kLo])/(Log10[kHi] - Log10[kLo]);\nfY[g_] := g/gHi;\nxLab  = 0.66;                                              (* label column, right of the fast peak *)\nlabFY = Table[0.96 - 0.86 (nC - i)/Max[nC - 1, 1], {i, nC}];   (* reverse conc: high at top *)\n\nconcEpilog = Flatten@Table[\n  With[{col = concCols[[i]], kp = concAnchors[[i, 1]], gp = concAnchors[[i, 2]],\n        ly = labFY[[i]], lbl = concLbls[[i]]},\n    {{col, AbsoluteThickness[0.7], Line[{Scaled[{xLab - 0.008, ly}], Scaled[{fX[kp], fY[gp]}]}]},\n     Style[Text[lbl, Scaled[{xLab, ly}], {-1, 0}], col, 14, Bold]}],\n  {i, nC}];\n\nDCTPlots`PlotGK[concE1, Automatic, \"AreaNorm\" -> True, PlotLegends -> None,\n  PlotRange -> {{kLo, kHi}, {0, gHi}}, PlotRangePadding -> None,\n  Epilog -> concEpilog, ImageSize -> 660]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"375116\" data-output-id=\"208\" data-out-n=\"1183\" data-sub-idx=\"17\" data-output-format=\"SVG\" data-output-is-graphics=\"1\" data-cell-idx=\"64\" data-sub-start=\"33\" data-sub-end=\"35\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[1183]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><span class=\"vscode-wolfram-gfx-marker\" style=\"display:none;\"></span><img class=\"vscode-wolfram-svg-output\" data-wl-img=\"c:\\Users\\bobla\\Documents\\DCT\\img\\EAB_DCT_analysis\\wl_83zyw73au3bb.svg\" src=\"img/EAB_DCT_analysis/wl_83zyw73au3bb.svg\"/></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "(* output: graphics *)\n(* Concentration g(k), area-normalised (each curve / its integrated capacitance),\n   with per-curve leader-line labels instead of a legend: each label sits to the\n   right of the fast peak and a thin colour-matched line points to that curve's\n   fast (folded) peak. The normalised fast peak grows monotonically with\n   concentration, so labels run 1000 -> 0 top-to-bottom and the leaders don't cross. *)\nconcE1   = Select[concGoodSpecs, StringStartsQ[#File, \"E1\"] &];\nnC       = Length[concE1];\nconcCols = Table[ColorData[\"Rainbow\"][u], {u, 0.05, 0.95, 0.9/Max[nC - 1, 1]}];\nconcLbls = StringTrim[StringDrop[#File, 2]] & /@ concE1;   (* \"0 \\[Mu]M\", ... (drop the \"E1\") *)\ngNorm[sp_] := sp[\"g\"]/Max[DCTPeakAnalysis`IntegrateSpectrum[sp], 1.*^-15];\n\n(* anchor each leader to that curve's fast peak (k in [100, 300] /s) *)\nfastAnchor[sp_] := Module[{k = 1./sp[\"Tau\"], gN = gNorm[sp], idx},\n  idx = Select[Range[Length[gN]], 100 <= k[[#]] <= 300 &];\n  If[idx === {}, idx = Range[Length[gN]]];\n  {k[[idx[[First@Ordering[gN[[idx]], -1]]]]], Max[gN[[idx]]]}];\nconcAnchors = fastAnchor[#Spec] & /@ concE1;\n\nallK = Flatten[1./#Spec[\"Tau\"] & /@ concE1];\n{kLo, kHi} = MinMax[allK];\ngHi  = Max[Flatten[gNorm[#Spec] & /@ concE1]] 1.08;\nfX[k_] := (Log10[k] - Log10[kLo])/(Log10[kHi] - Log10[kLo]);\nfY[g_] := g/gHi;\nxLab  = 0.66;                                              (* label column, right of the fast peak *)\nlabFY = Table[0.96 - 0.86 (nC - i)/Max[nC - 1, 1], {i, nC}];   (* reverse conc: high at top *)\n\nconcEpilog = Flatten@Table[\n  With[{col = concCols[[i]], kp = concAnchors[[i, 1]], gp = concAnchors[[i, 2]],\n        ly = labFY[[i]], lbl = concLbls[[i]]},\n    {{col, AbsoluteThickness[0.7], Line[{Scaled[{xLab - 0.008, ly}], Scaled[{fX[kp], fY[gp]}]}]},\n     Style[Text[lbl, Scaled[{xLab, ly}], {-1, 0}], col, 14, Bold]}],\n  {i, nC}];\n\nDCTPlots`PlotGK[concE1, Automatic, \"AreaNorm\" -> True, PlotLegends -> None,\n  PlotRange -> {{kLo, kHi}, {0, gHi}}, PlotRangePadding -> None,\n  Epilog -> concEpilog, ImageSize -> 660]",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "4106b2c5-6b6c-4107-96d0-eb556ae33420"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### 5.3.b Method schematic panels (one intermediate concentration)\nThe 'before' and 'after' of the inversion for a single representative spectrum (E1 at schemConc uM): (a) the raw EIS Bode magnitude + phase, and (c) the recovered DCT spectrum g(k). Drop the inversion cartoon (b) in the gap between them. Change schemConc to use a different concentration; theme-aware (dark + publication).",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* 5.3.b  Method-schematic panels for one representative intermediate concentration:\n   (a) the raw EIS Bode magnitude + phase, and (c) the recovered DCT spectrum g(k)\n   -- the \"before\" and \"after\" of the inversion. schemPanels[] returns both panels\n   (keys \"eis\" and \"dct\") so this cell and the export share one definition; theme-aware.\n   Change schemConc to pick a different [vancomycin]. *)\nschemConc = 178;   (* intermediate [vancomycin], uM *)\nschemSpec = First[Select[concGoodSpecs, StringStartsQ[#File, \"E1 \" <> ToString[schemConc] <> \" \"] &]][\"Spec\"];\nschemCol  = RGBColor[0.05, 0.28, 0.72];   (* deep cobalt blue *)\n\nschemPanels[] := Module[\n  {fg, bg, f = schemSpec[\"FreqHz\"], z = schemSpec[\"ZData\"], magD, phD, magP, phP, kLab, dctBase},\n  fg = If[DCTPlots`$DCTTheme === \"Publication\", Black, White];\n  bg = If[DCTPlots`$DCTTheme === \"Publication\", White, GrayLevel[0.12]];\n  magD = Transpose[{f, Abs[z]/1000.}];\n  phD  = Transpose[{f, (180./Pi) Arg[z]}];\n  magP = ListLogLogPlot[magD, Joined -> True, PlotStyle -> Directive[schemCol, AbsoluteThickness[2.5]],\n    Frame -> True, Axes -> False, Background -> bg, PlotTheme -> \"Default\",\n    FrameStyle -> Directive[fg, AbsoluteThickness[1.1]],\n    FrameTicks -> {{DCTPlots`ThemeLogTicks[Min[Abs[z]]/1000., Max[Abs[z]]/1000., fg], None},\n                   {DCTPlots`ThemeLogTicks[Min[f], Max[f], fg], None}},\n    FrameTicksStyle -> Directive[fg, 11], LabelStyle -> Directive[fg, 12, FontFamily -> \"Arial\"],\n    FrameLabel -> {None, Style[\"|Z| (k\\[CapitalOmega])\", 13, fg]}, ImageSize -> 300, AspectRatio -> 0.7];\n  phP = ListLogLinearPlot[phD, Joined -> True, PlotStyle -> Directive[schemCol, AbsoluteThickness[2.5]],\n    Frame -> True, Axes -> False, Background -> bg, PlotTheme -> \"Default\",\n    FrameStyle -> Directive[fg, AbsoluteThickness[1.1]],\n    FrameTicks -> {{DCTPlots`ThemeLinTicks[Min[phD[[All, 2]]], Max[phD[[All, 2]]], fg], None},\n                   {DCTPlots`ThemeLogTicks[Min[f], Max[f], fg], None}},\n    FrameTicksStyle -> Directive[fg, 11], LabelStyle -> Directive[fg, 12, FontFamily -> \"Arial\"],\n    FrameLabel -> {Style[\"Frequency (Hz)\", 13, fg], Style[\"Phase (\\[Degree])\", 13, fg]},\n    ImageSize -> 300, AspectRatio -> 0.7];\n  (* DCT panel: nF/decade, with a HORIZONTAL y-label sat above the axis *)\n  kLab = Style[Row[{\"Electron-transfer rate, k (\", Superscript[\"s\", -1], \")\"}], 13, fg];\n  dctBase = DCTPlots`PlotGK[{<|\"File\" -> ToString[schemConc] <> \" \\[Mu]M\", \"Spec\" -> schemSpec|>},\n    \"GScale\" -> 1*^9, PlotStyle -> Directive[schemCol, AbsoluteThickness[2.5]], PlotLegends -> None,\n    FrameLabel -> {kLab, None}, ImagePadding -> {{58, 14}, {52, 8}}, ImageSize -> 430];\n  <|\"eis\" -> Column[{magP, phP}, Alignment -> Center, Spacings -> 0.4],\n    \"dct\" -> Column[{Style[\"g(k) (nF/decade)\", fg, 13], dctBase}, Alignment -> Left, Spacings -> 0.1]|>];\n\nWith[{p = schemPanels[]},\n  Grid[{{p[\"eis\"], p[\"dct\"]}}, Alignment -> {Center, Center}, Spacings -> {4, 0.5}]]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"375116\" data-output-id=\"209\" data-out-n=\"1188\" data-sub-idx=\"5\" data-output-format=\"SVG\" data-output-is-graphics=\"1\" data-cell-idx=\"66\" data-sub-start=\"38\" data-sub-end=\"39\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[1188]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><span class=\"vscode-wolfram-gfx-marker\" style=\"display:none;\"></span><img class=\"vscode-wolfram-svg-output\" data-wl-img=\"c:\\Users\\bobla\\Documents\\DCT\\img\\EAB_DCT_analysis\\wl_1dson91joq0gx.svg\" src=\"img/EAB_DCT_analysis/wl_1dson91joq0gx.svg\"/></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "(* output: graphics *)\n(* 5.3.b  Method-schematic panels for one representative intermediate concentration:\n   (a) the raw EIS Bode magnitude + phase, and (c) the recovered DCT spectrum g(k)\n   -- the \"before\" and \"after\" of the inversion. schemPanels[] returns both panels\n   (keys \"eis\" and \"dct\") so this cell and the export share one definition; theme-aware.\n   Change schemConc to pick a different [vancomycin]. *)\nschemConc = 178;   (* intermediate [vancomycin], uM *)\nschemSpec = First[Select[concGoodSpecs, StringStartsQ[#File, \"E1 \" <> ToString[schemConc] <> \" \"] &]][\"Spec\"];\nschemCol  = RGBColor[0.05, 0.28, 0.72];   (* deep cobalt blue *)\n\nschemPanels[] := Module[\n  {fg, bg, f = schemSpec[\"FreqHz\"], z = schemSpec[\"ZData\"], magD, phD, magP, phP, kLab, dctBase},\n  fg = If[DCTPlots`$DCTTheme === \"Publication\", Black, White];\n  bg = If[DCTPlots`$DCTTheme === \"Publication\", White, GrayLevel[0.12]];\n  magD = Transpose[{f, Abs[z]/1000.}];\n  phD  = Transpose[{f, (180./Pi) Arg[z]}];\n  magP = ListLogLogPlot[magD, Joined -> True, PlotStyle -> Directive[schemCol, AbsoluteThickness[2.5]],\n    Frame -> True, Axes -> False, Background -> bg, PlotTheme -> \"Default\",\n    FrameStyle -> Directive[fg, AbsoluteThickness[1.1]],\n    FrameTicks -> {{DCTPlots`ThemeLogTicks[Min[Abs[z]]/1000., Max[Abs[z]]/1000., fg], None},\n                   {DCTPlots`ThemeLogTicks[Min[f], Max[f], fg], None}},\n    FrameTicksStyle -> Directive[fg, 11], LabelStyle -> Directive[fg, 12, FontFamily -> \"Arial\"],\n    FrameLabel -> {None, Style[\"|Z| (k\\[CapitalOmega])\", 13, fg]}, ImageSize -> 300, AspectRatio -> 0.7];\n  phP = ListLogLinearPlot[phD, Joined -> True, PlotStyle -> Directive[schemCol, AbsoluteThickness[2.5]],\n    Frame -> True, Axes -> False, Background -> bg, PlotTheme -> \"Default\",\n    FrameStyle -> Directive[fg, AbsoluteThickness[1.1]],\n    FrameTicks -> {{DCTPlots`ThemeLinTicks[Min[phD[[All, 2]]], Max[phD[[All, 2]]], fg], None},\n                   {DCTPlots`ThemeLogTicks[Min[f], Max[f], fg], None}},\n    FrameTicksStyle -> Directive[fg, 11], LabelStyle -> Directive[fg, 12, FontFamily -> \"Arial\"],\n    FrameLabel -> {Style[\"Frequency (Hz)\", 13, fg], Style[\"Phase (\\[Degree])\", 13, fg]},\n    ImageSize -> 300, AspectRatio -> 0.7];\n  (* DCT panel: nF/decade, with a HORIZONTAL y-label sat above the axis *)\n  kLab = Style[Row[{\"Electron-transfer rate, k (\", Superscript[\"s\", -1], \")\"}], 13, fg];\n  dctBase = DCTPlots`PlotGK[{<|\"File\" -> ToString[schemConc] <> \" \\[Mu]M\", \"Spec\" -> schemSpec|>},\n    \"GScale\" -> 1*^9, PlotStyle -> Directive[schemCol, AbsoluteThickness[2.5]], PlotLegends -> None,\n    FrameLabel -> {kLab, None}, ImagePadding -> {{58, 14}, {52, 8}}, ImageSize -> 430];\n  <|\"eis\" -> Column[{magP, phP}, Alignment -> Center, Spacings -> 0.4],\n    \"dct\" -> Column[{Style[\"g(k) (nF/decade)\", fg, 13], dctBase}, Alignment -> Left, Spacings -> 0.1]|>];\n\nWith[{p = schemPanels[]},\n  Grid[{{p[\"eis\"], p[\"dct\"]}}, Alignment -> {Center, Center}, Spacings -> {4, 0.5}]]",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "c20c4e29-11a5-48e2-b5a0-3145523a6d1a"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### 5.3.2 Raw EIS Bode spectra — full E1 concentration series\nThe measured impedance behind the 5.3 g(k) curves: magnitude |Z| (k\\[CapitalOmega]) on top, phase (\\[Degree]) below, one rainbow-coloured curve per [vancomycin] (violet = 0 \\[Mu]M → red = 1000 \\[Mu]M, same colours as 5.3). The phase carries a low-frequency bump (the folded population) that marches to higher frequency and deepens with concentration; cascaded callout labels fan it out (0 \\[Mu]M near 5 Hz → 1000 \\[Mu]M near 100 Hz). Theme-aware (dark + publication).\n\n*Note: `ListLogLinearPlot` Epilog x-coordinates are **natural** log (`Log`), not `Log10`.*",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* 5.3.2  Raw EIS Bode spectra for the full E1 [vancomycin] series.\n   Magnitude (k\\[CapitalOmega], linear) on top, phase (\\[Degree]) below, one rainbow curve\n   per concentration (violet 0 \\[Mu]M -> red 1000 \\[Mu]M, matching 5.3). The phase bump\n   near 10-30 Hz (folded population) shifts up in frequency with [vancomycin], so the\n   cascaded callout labels fan left-to-right (0 \\[Mu]M ~5 Hz -> 1000 \\[Mu]M ~100 Hz) and the\n   colour-matched arrows point each label to its curve's bump. Theme-aware.\n   NB: ListLogLinearPlot's Epilog x-coordinates are NATURAL log (Log), not Log10. *)\n\nbodeUM[lbl_] := ToExpression @ First[StringCases[lbl, n : NumberString ~~ \" \\[Mu]M\" :> n], \"0\"];\nbodeE1    = SortBy[Select[concGoodSpecs, StringStartsQ[#File, \"E1 \"] &], bodeUM[#File] &];\nbodeConcs = bodeUM /@ bodeE1[[All, \"File\"]];\nbodeCols  = Table[ColorData[\"Rainbow\"][u], {u, 0.05, 0.95, 0.9/Max[Length[bodeE1] - 1, 1]}];\n\nbodeSeriesPlot[] := Module[\n  {fg, bg, nC = Length[bodeE1], magCurves, phCurves, peaks, aEnd, magMax, magMin, yLo, fMin, fMax, ux, uy, topY, asp, arrowLen, labGap, angHi, angLo, thAng, heads, tails, labP, lab, magP, phP, gN, dctAnchor, dctAnchors, allK, kLo, kHi, gHi, fXk, fYg, xLab, labFY, dctEpilog, dctP},\n  fg = If[DCTPlots`$DCTTheme === \"Publication\", Black, White];\n  bg = If[DCTPlots`$DCTTheme === \"Publication\", White, GrayLevel[0.12]];\n  magCurves = Transpose[{#Spec[\"FreqHz\"], Abs[#Spec[\"ZData\"]]/1000.}] & /@ bodeE1;\n  phCurves  = Transpose[{#Spec[\"FreqHz\"], (180./Pi) Arg[#Spec[\"ZData\"]]}] & /@ bodeE1;\n  (* the phase bump (folded population) for each curve, restricted to 4-55 Hz *)\n  peaks = Table[Module[{c = Select[phCurves[[i]], 4 <= #[[1]] <= 55 &]},\n     c[[First @ Ordering[c[[All, 2]], -1]]]], {i, nC}];\n  (* most arrows point at the bump peak, but pull the 0 \\[Mu]M head to a lower\n     frequency (~6.5 Hz) so it clears the 1 \\[Mu]M head (the two lowest curves overlap) *)\n  aEnd = peaks;\n  aEnd[[1]] = phCurves[[1]][[First @ Ordering[Abs[Log10[phCurves[[1]][[All, 1]]] - Log10[6.5]], 1]]];\n  magMax = Max[Flatten[magCurves[[All, All, 2]]]];\n  magMin = Min[Flatten[magCurves[[All, All, 2]]]];\n  yLo    = Min[Flatten[phCurves[[All, All, 2]]]];\n  fMin   = Min[Flatten[phCurves[[All, All, 1]]]]; fMax = Max[Flatten[phCurves[[All, All, 1]]]];\n  (* callout arrows fan at a linearly varying SCREEN angle (0 \\[Mu]M -> angHi, highest [vanco] -> angLo);\n     heads pin to each curve's phase bump, the label sits at the arrow tail. ux/uy/asp convert the\n     screen angle into the mixed-unit (natural-log Hz x degrees) Epilog coords. Tune {angHi,angLo},\n     arrowLen (fraction of frame width), and topY (frame top -> less/more headroom). *)\n  {angHi, angLo} = {-60., -120.};  arrowLen = 0.11;  labGap = 0.03;  asp = 0.52;\n  ux = Log[fMax] - Log[fMin];  topY = -63.;  uy = topY - (yLo - 1.);\n  thAng = Table[(angHi + (angLo - angHi) (i - 1)/Max[nC - 1, 1]) Degree, {i, nC}];\n  heads = Table[{Log[aEnd[[i, 1]]], aEnd[[i, 2]] + 0.6}, {i, nC}];\n  tails = Table[heads[[i]] - arrowLen          {Cos[thAng[[i]]] ux, Sin[thAng[[i]]] uy/asp}, {i, nC}];\n  labP  = Table[heads[[i]] - (arrowLen + labGap) {Cos[thAng[[i]]] ux, Sin[thAng[[i]]] uy/asp}, {i, nC}];\n  lab[i_] := {{bodeCols[[i]], Opacity[0.9], Arrowheads[0.013], AbsoluteThickness[1.],\n      Arrow[{tails[[i]], heads[[i]]}]},\n     Text[Style[ToString[bodeConcs[[i]]] <> \" \\[Mu]M\", bodeCols[[i]], 10, Bold], labP[[i]], {Cos[thAng[[i]]], Sin[thAng[[i]]]}]};\n  magP = ListLogLogPlot[magCurves, Joined -> True,\n    PlotStyle -> (Directive[#, AbsoluteThickness[2.]] & /@ bodeCols),\n    Frame -> True, Axes -> False, Background -> bg, PlotTheme -> \"Default\",\n    FrameStyle -> Directive[fg, AbsoluteThickness[1.1]],\n    FrameTicks -> {{DCTPlots`ThemeLogTicks[magMin, magMax, fg], None}, {DCTPlots`ThemeLogTicks[fMin, fMax, fg], None}},\n    FrameTicksStyle -> Directive[fg, 11], LabelStyle -> Directive[fg, 12, FontFamily -> \"Arial\"],\n    FrameLabel -> {None, Style[\"|Z| (k\\[CapitalOmega])\", 13, fg]},\n    ImageSize -> 600, AspectRatio -> 0.42, ImagePadding -> {{62, 12}, {6, 8}}, PlotLegends -> None,\n    Epilog -> {Text[Style[\"a\", 15, Bold, fg, Background -> bg], Scaled[{0.03, 0.86}], {-1, 1}]}];\n  phP = ListLogLinearPlot[phCurves, Joined -> True,\n    PlotStyle -> (Directive[#, AbsoluteThickness[2.]] & /@ bodeCols),\n    Frame -> True, Axes -> False, Background -> bg, PlotTheme -> \"Default\",\n    FrameStyle -> Directive[fg, AbsoluteThickness[1.1]],\n    FrameTicks -> {{DCTPlots`ThemeLinTicks[yLo, -70., fg], None}, {DCTPlots`ThemeLogTicks[fMin, fMax, fg], None}},\n    FrameTicksStyle -> Directive[fg, 11], LabelStyle -> Directive[fg, 12, FontFamily -> \"Arial\"],\n    FrameLabel -> {Style[\"Frequency (Hz)\", 13, fg], Style[\"Phase (\\[Degree])\", 13, fg]},\n    PlotRange -> {Automatic, {yLo - 1, topY}}, \n    ImageSize -> 600, \n    AspectRatio -> 0.6,\n    ImagePadding -> {{62, 12}, {46, 6}}, PlotLegends -> None, Epilog -> Append[Flatten[lab /@ Range[nC]], Text[Style[\"b\", 15, Bold, fg, Background -> bg], Scaled[{0.03, 0.9}], {-1, 1}]]];\n  (* DCT g(k) panel for the same series: absolute g(k) (nF/decade), leader-line labels (cf. 5.3) *)\n  gN[sp_] := 1.*^9 sp[\"g\"];\n  dctAnchor[sp_] := Module[{k = 1./sp[\"Tau\"], g = gN[sp], idx},\n    idx = Select[Range[Length[g]], 100 <= k[[#]] <= 300 &];\n    If[idx === {}, idx = Range[Length[g]]];\n    {k[[idx[[First @ Ordering[g[[idx]], -1]]]]], Max[g[[idx]]]}];\n  dctAnchors = dctAnchor[#Spec] & /@ bodeE1;\n  allK = Flatten[1./#Spec[\"Tau\"] & /@ bodeE1];\n  {kLo, kHi} = MinMax[allK];\n  gHi = Max[Flatten[gN[#Spec] & /@ bodeE1]] 1.08;\n  fXk[k_] := (Log10[k] - Log10[kLo])/(Log10[kHi] - Log10[kLo]);\n  fYg[g_] := g/gHi;\n  xLab = 0.66;\n  labFY = Table[0.96 - 0.86 (nC - i)/Max[nC - 1, 1], {i, nC}];\n  dctEpilog = Flatten @ Table[\n    With[{col = bodeCols[[i]], kp = dctAnchors[[i, 1]], gp = dctAnchors[[i, 2]],\n          ly = labFY[[i]], lbl = ToString[bodeConcs[[i]]] <> \" \\[Mu]M\"},\n      {{col, AbsoluteThickness[0.7], Line[{Scaled[{xLab - 0.008, ly}], Scaled[{fXk[kp], fYg[gp]}]}]},\n       Style[Text[lbl, Scaled[{xLab, ly}], {-1, 0}], col, 14, Bold]}],\n    {i, nC}];\n  dctP = DCTPlots`PlotGK[bodeE1, Automatic, \"GScale\" -> 1.*^9, PlotLegends -> None,\n    PlotRange -> {{kLo, kHi}, {0, gHi}}, PlotRangePadding -> None, Epilog -> Append[dctEpilog, Text[Style[\"c\", 15, Bold, fg, Background -> bg], Scaled[{0.03, 0.92}], {-1, 1}]],\n    ImageSize -> 660, AspectRatio -> 0.6];\n  Grid[{{Column[{magP, phP}, Spacings -> 0, Alignment -> Left], dctP}},\n    Alignment -> {Center, Center}, Spacings -> {2, 0}]];\n\nbodeSeriesPlot[]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"375116\" data-output-id=\"234\" data-out-n=\"1330\" data-sub-idx=\"6\" data-output-format=\"SVG\" data-output-is-graphics=\"1\" data-cell-idx=\"68\" data-sub-start=\"88\" data-sub-end=\"88\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[1330]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><span class=\"vscode-wolfram-gfx-marker\" style=\"display:none;\"></span><img class=\"vscode-wolfram-svg-output\" data-wl-img=\"c:\\Users\\bobla\\Documents\\DCT\\img\\EAB_DCT_analysis\\wl_1wy351ourysxa.svg\" src=\"img/EAB_DCT_analysis/wl_1wy351ourysxa.svg\"/></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "(* output: graphics *)\n(* 5.3.2  Raw EIS Bode spectra for the full E1 [vancomycin] series.\n   Magnitude (k\\[CapitalOmega], linear) on top, phase (\\[Degree]) below, one rainbow curve\n   per concentration (violet 0 \\[Mu]M -> red 1000 \\[Mu]M, matching 5.3). The phase bump\n   near 10-30 Hz (folded population) shifts up in frequency with [vancomycin], so the\n   cascaded callout labels fan left-to-right (0 \\[Mu]M ~5 Hz -> 1000 \\[Mu]M ~100 Hz) and the\n   colour-matched arrows point each label to its curve's bump. Theme-aware.\n   NB: ListLogLinearPlot's Epilog x-coordinates are NATURAL log (Log), not Log10. *)\n\nbodeUM[lbl_] := ToExpression @ First[StringCases[lbl, n : NumberString ~~ \" \\[Mu]M\" :> n], \"0\"];\nbodeE1    = SortBy[Select[concGoodSpecs, StringStartsQ[#File, \"E1 \"] &], bodeUM[#File] &];\nbodeConcs = bodeUM /@ bodeE1[[All, \"File\"]];\nbodeCols  = Table[ColorData[\"Rainbow\"][u], {u, 0.05, 0.95, 0.9/Max[Length[bodeE1] - 1, 1]}];\n\nbodeSeriesPlot[] := Module[\n  {fg, bg, nC = Length[bodeE1], magCurves, phCurves, peaks, aEnd, magMax, magMin, yLo, fMin, fMax, ux, uy, topY, asp, arrowLen, labGap, angHi, angLo, thAng, heads, tails, labP, lab, magP, phP, gN, dctAnchor, dctAnchors, allK, kLo, kHi, gHi, fXk, fYg, xLab, labFY, dctEpilog, dctP},\n  fg = If[DCTPlots`$DCTTheme === \"Publication\", Black, White];\n  bg = If[DCTPlots`$DCTTheme === \"Publication\", White, GrayLevel[0.12]];\n  magCurves = Transpose[{#Spec[\"FreqHz\"], Abs[#Spec[\"ZData\"]]/1000.}] & /@ bodeE1;\n  phCurves  = Transpose[{#Spec[\"FreqHz\"], (180./Pi) Arg[#Spec[\"ZData\"]]}] & /@ bodeE1;\n  (* the phase bump (folded population) for each curve, restricted to 4-55 Hz *)\n  peaks = Table[Module[{c = Select[phCurves[[i]], 4 <= #[[1]] <= 55 &]},\n     c[[First @ Ordering[c[[All, 2]], -1]]]], {i, nC}];\n  (* most arrows point at the bump peak, but pull the 0 \\[Mu]M head to a lower\n     frequency (~6.5 Hz) so it clears the 1 \\[Mu]M head (the two lowest curves overlap) *)\n  aEnd = peaks;\n  aEnd[[1]] = phCurves[[1]][[First @ Ordering[Abs[Log10[phCurves[[1]][[All, 1]]] - Log10[6.5]], 1]]];\n  magMax = Max[Flatten[magCurves[[All, All, 2]]]];\n  magMin = Min[Flatten[magCurves[[All, All, 2]]]];\n  yLo    = Min[Flatten[phCurves[[All, All, 2]]]];\n  fMin   = Min[Flatten[phCurves[[All, All, 1]]]]; fMax = Max[Flatten[phCurves[[All, All, 1]]]];\n  (* callout arrows fan at a linearly varying SCREEN angle (0 \\[Mu]M -> angHi, highest [vanco] -> angLo);\n     heads pin to each curve's phase bump, the label sits at the arrow tail. ux/uy/asp convert the\n     screen angle into the mixed-unit (natural-log Hz x degrees) Epilog coords. Tune {angHi,angLo},\n     arrowLen (fraction of frame width), and topY (frame top -> less/more headroom). *)\n  {angHi, angLo} = {-60., -120.};  arrowLen = 0.11;  labGap = 0.03;  asp = 0.52;\n  ux = Log[fMax] - Log[fMin];  topY = -63.;  uy = topY - (yLo - 1.);\n  thAng = Table[(angHi + (angLo - angHi) (i - 1)/Max[nC - 1, 1]) Degree, {i, nC}];\n  heads = Table[{Log[aEnd[[i, 1]]], aEnd[[i, 2]] + 0.6}, {i, nC}];\n  tails = Table[heads[[i]] - arrowLen          {Cos[thAng[[i]]] ux, Sin[thAng[[i]]] uy/asp}, {i, nC}];\n  labP  = Table[heads[[i]] - (arrowLen + labGap) {Cos[thAng[[i]]] ux, Sin[thAng[[i]]] uy/asp}, {i, nC}];\n  lab[i_] := {{bodeCols[[i]], Opacity[0.9], Arrowheads[0.013], AbsoluteThickness[1.],\n      Arrow[{tails[[i]], heads[[i]]}]},\n     Text[Style[ToString[bodeConcs[[i]]] <> \" \\[Mu]M\", bodeCols[[i]], 10, Bold], labP[[i]], {Cos[thAng[[i]]], Sin[thAng[[i]]]}]};\n  magP = ListLogLogPlot[magCurves, Joined -> True,\n    PlotStyle -> (Directive[#, AbsoluteThickness[2.]] & /@ bodeCols),\n    Frame -> True, Axes -> False, Background -> bg, PlotTheme -> \"Default\",\n    FrameStyle -> Directive[fg, AbsoluteThickness[1.1]],\n    FrameTicks -> {{DCTPlots`ThemeLogTicks[magMin, magMax, fg], None}, {DCTPlots`ThemeLogTicks[fMin, fMax, fg], None}},\n    FrameTicksStyle -> Directive[fg, 11], LabelStyle -> Directive[fg, 12, FontFamily -> \"Arial\"],\n    FrameLabel -> {None, Style[\"|Z| (k\\[CapitalOmega])\", 13, fg]},\n    ImageSize -> 600, AspectRatio -> 0.42, ImagePadding -> {{62, 12}, {6, 8}}, PlotLegends -> None,\n    Epilog -> {Text[Style[\"a\", 15, Bold, fg, Background -> bg], Scaled[{0.03, 0.86}], {-1, 1}]}];\n  phP = ListLogLinearPlot[phCurves, Joined -> True,\n    PlotStyle -> (Directive[#, AbsoluteThickness[2.]] & /@ bodeCols),\n    Frame -> True, Axes -> False, Background -> bg, PlotTheme -> \"Default\",\n    FrameStyle -> Directive[fg, AbsoluteThickness[1.1]],\n    FrameTicks -> {{DCTPlots`ThemeLinTicks[yLo, -70., fg], None}, {DCTPlots`ThemeLogTicks[fMin, fMax, fg], None}},\n    FrameTicksStyle -> Directive[fg, 11], LabelStyle -> Directive[fg, 12, FontFamily -> \"Arial\"],\n    FrameLabel -> {Style[\"Frequency (Hz)\", 13, fg], Style[\"Phase (\\[Degree])\", 13, fg]},\n    PlotRange -> {Automatic, {yLo - 1, topY}}, \n    ImageSize -> 600, \n    AspectRatio -> 0.6,\n    ImagePadding -> {{62, 12}, {46, 6}}, PlotLegends -> None, Epilog -> Append[Flatten[lab /@ Range[nC]], Text[Style[\"b\", 15, Bold, fg, Background -> bg], Scaled[{0.03, 0.9}], {-1, 1}]]];\n  (* DCT g(k) panel for the same series: absolute g(k) (nF/decade), leader-line labels (cf. 5.3) *)\n  gN[sp_] := 1.*^9 sp[\"g\"];\n  dctAnchor[sp_] := Module[{k = 1./sp[\"Tau\"], g = gN[sp], idx},\n    idx = Select[Range[Length[g]], 100 <= k[[#]] <= 300 &];\n    If[idx === {}, idx = Range[Length[g]]];\n    {k[[idx[[First @ Ordering[g[[idx]], -1]]]]], Max[g[[idx]]]}];\n  dctAnchors = dctAnchor[#Spec] & /@ bodeE1;\n  allK = Flatten[1./#Spec[\"Tau\"] & /@ bodeE1];\n  {kLo, kHi} = MinMax[allK];\n  gHi = Max[Flatten[gN[#Spec] & /@ bodeE1]] 1.08;\n  fXk[k_] := (Log10[k] - Log10[kLo])/(Log10[kHi] - Log10[kLo]);\n  fYg[g_] := g/gHi;\n  xLab = 0.66;\n  labFY = Table[0.96 - 0.86 (nC - i)/Max[nC - 1, 1], {i, nC}];\n  dctEpilog = Flatten @ Table[\n    With[{col = bodeCols[[i]], kp = dctAnchors[[i, 1]], gp = dctAnchors[[i, 2]],\n          ly = labFY[[i]], lbl = ToString[bodeConcs[[i]]] <> \" \\[Mu]M\"},\n      {{col, AbsoluteThickness[0.7], Line[{Scaled[{xLab - 0.008, ly}], Scaled[{fXk[kp], fYg[gp]}]}]},\n       Style[Text[lbl, Scaled[{xLab, ly}], {-1, 0}], col, 14, Bold]}],\n    {i, nC}];\n  dctP = DCTPlots`PlotGK[bodeE1, Automatic, \"GScale\" -> 1.*^9, PlotLegends -> None,\n    PlotRange -> {{kLo, kHi}, {0, gHi}}, PlotRangePadding -> None, Epilog -> Append[dctEpilog, Text[Style[\"c\", 15, Bold, fg, Background -> bg], Scaled[{0.03, 0.92}], {-1, 1}]],\n    ImageSize -> 660, AspectRatio -> 0.6];\n  Grid[{{Column[{magP, phP}, Spacings -> 0, Alignment -> Left], dctP}},\n    Alignment -> {Center, Center}, Spacings -> {2, 0}]];\n\nbodeSeriesPlot[]",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "4ac662ec-1b80-4fba-9086-3f79776e807a"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### 5.4 Fraction folded",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* Fraction folded vs [vancomycin].\n   k_peak shifts from the unbound population (range 1) to the bound/folded population (range 2).\n   ff = area(range 2) / (area(range 1) + area(range 2)) \\[Dash] naturally 0 to 1. *)\n\nareaWindow[spec_, kLo_, kHi_] := Module[{tau, g, k, logK, n},\n  tau = spec[\"Tau\"]; g = spec[\"g\"]; k = 1./tau; logK = Log10[k]; n = Length[g];\n  If[n < 2, Return[0.]];\n  Total @ Table[If[0.5(k[[j]]+k[[j+1]]) >= kLo && 0.5(k[[j]]+k[[j+1]]) <= kHi,\n    0.5(g[[j]]+g[[j+1]]) Abs[logK[[j+1]]-logK[[j]]], 0.], {j, n-1}]\n];\n\ngetLabelUM[lbl_] := ToExpression @ First[StringCases[lbl, n:NumberString ~~ \" \\[Mu]M\" :> n], \"0\"];\n\n(* one {conc, ff} list per electrode (concElectrodes = E1..E6 from the fit cell) *)\nffPerElectrode = Table[\n  Module[{subs, concs, a1, a2, ff},\n    subs  = Select[concGoodSpecs, StringStartsQ[#File, e] &];\n    concs = N @ (getLabelUM /@ subs[[All, \"File\"]]);\n    a1    = areaWindow[#Spec, kPeakRanges[[1,1]], kPeakRanges[[1,2]]] & /@ subs;\n    a2    = areaWindow[#Spec, kPeakRanges[[2,1]], kPeakRanges[[2,2]]] & /@ subs;\n    ff    = MapThread[If[#1+#2 > 0., #2/(#1+#2), 0.] &, {a1, a2}];\n    Transpose[{concs, ff}]\n  ],\n  {e, concElectrodes}\n];\n\n(* per-electrode: drop 0 \\[Mu]M for the log-x plots (electrodes have different conc grids) *)\nffPos = Select[#, First[#] > 0 &] & /@ ffPerElectrode;\ncHi   = Max[Flatten[ffPerElectrode[[All, All, 1]]]] * 1.1;\n\ndarkBg  = GrayLevel[0.12];\nfgStyle = Directive[White, AbsoluteThickness[1.1]];\neCols   = Directive[ColorData[97][#], AbsoluteThickness[1.8]] & /@ Range[Length[concElectrodes]];\n\nListLinePlot[ffPos,\n  ScalingFunctions -> {\"Log10\", None},\n  Joined -> False, PlotMarkers -> {Automatic, 10}, PlotStyle -> eCols,\n  FrameTicks -> {{DCTPlots`ThemeLinTicks[0., 1., White], None}, {DCTPlots`ThemeLogTicks[0.8, cHi, White], None}},\n  FrameTicksStyle -> Directive[White, 12],\n  Frame -> True, Axes -> False, Background -> darkBg, FrameStyle -> fgStyle,\n  LabelStyle -> Directive[White, 14, FontFamily -> \"Arial\"],\n  FrameLabel -> {Style[\"[Vancomycin] (\\[Mu]M)\", 14, White], Style[\"Fraction folded\", 14, White]},\n  PlotRange -> {{0.8, cHi}, {0, 1}},\n  PlotRangePadding -> Scaled[0.04],\n  ImageSize -> 500, AspectRatio -> 0.75,\n  PlotLegends -> Placed[LineLegend[eCols, concElectrodes,\n    LabelStyle -> Directive[White, 12], Background -> darkBg,\n    LegendFunction -> (Framed[#, Background->darkBg, FrameStyle->fgStyle]&)], Right]\n]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"375116\" data-output-id=\"211\" data-out-n=\"1203\" data-sub-idx=\"11\" data-output-format=\"SVG\" data-output-is-graphics=\"1\" data-cell-idx=\"70\" data-sub-start=\"34\" data-sub-end=\"48\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[1203]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><span class=\"vscode-wolfram-gfx-marker\" style=\"display:none;\"></span><img class=\"vscode-wolfram-svg-output\" data-wl-img=\"c:\\Users\\bobla\\Documents\\DCT\\img\\EAB_DCT_analysis\\wl_1eqvo6aatf722.svg\" src=\"img/EAB_DCT_analysis/wl_1eqvo6aatf722.svg\"/></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "(* output: graphics *)\n(* Fraction folded vs [vancomycin].\n   k_peak shifts from the unbound population (range 1) to the bound/folded population (range 2).\n   ff = area(range 2) / (area(range 1) + area(range 2)) \\[Dash] naturally 0 to 1. *)\n\nareaWindow[spec_, kLo_, kHi_] := Module[{tau, g, k, logK, n},\n  tau = spec[\"Tau\"]; g = spec[\"g\"]; k = 1./tau; logK = Log10[k]; n = Length[g];\n  If[n < 2, Return[0.]];\n  Total @ Table[If[0.5(k[[j]]+k[[j+1]]) >= kLo && 0.5(k[[j]]+k[[j+1]]) <= kHi,\n    0.5(g[[j]]+g[[j+1]]) Abs[logK[[j+1]]-logK[[j]]], 0.], {j, n-1}]\n];\n\ngetLabelUM[lbl_] := ToExpression @ First[StringCases[lbl, n:NumberString ~~ \" \\[Mu]M\" :> n], \"0\"];\n\n(* one {conc, ff} list per electrode (concElectrodes = E1..E6 from the fit cell) *)\nffPerElectrode = Table[\n  Module[{subs, concs, a1, a2, ff},\n    subs  = Select[concGoodSpecs, StringStartsQ[#File, e] &];\n    concs = N @ (getLabelUM /@ subs[[All, \"File\"]]);\n    a1    = areaWindow[#Spec, kPeakRanges[[1,1]], kPeakRanges[[1,2]]] & /@ subs;\n    a2    = areaWindow[#Spec, kPeakRanges[[2,1]], kPeakRanges[[2,2]]] & /@ subs;\n    ff    = MapThread[If[#1+#2 > 0., #2/(#1+#2), 0.] &, {a1, a2}];\n    Transpose[{concs, ff}]\n  ],\n  {e, concElectrodes}\n];\n\n(* per-electrode: drop 0 \\[Mu]M for the log-x plots (electrodes have different conc grids) *)\nffPos = Select[#, First[#] > 0 &] & /@ ffPerElectrode;\ncHi   = Max[Flatten[ffPerElectrode[[All, All, 1]]]] * 1.1;\n\ndarkBg  = GrayLevel[0.12];\nfgStyle = Directive[White, AbsoluteThickness[1.1]];\neCols   = Directive[ColorData[97][#], AbsoluteThickness[1.8]] & /@ Range[Length[concElectrodes]];\n\nListLinePlot[ffPos,\n  ScalingFunctions -> {\"Log10\", None},\n  Joined -> False, PlotMarkers -> {Automatic, 10}, PlotStyle -> eCols,\n  FrameTicks -> {{DCTPlots`ThemeLinTicks[0., 1., White], None}, {DCTPlots`ThemeLogTicks[0.8, cHi, White], None}},\n  FrameTicksStyle -> Directive[White, 12],\n  Frame -> True, Axes -> False, Background -> darkBg, FrameStyle -> fgStyle,\n  LabelStyle -> Directive[White, 14, FontFamily -> \"Arial\"],\n  FrameLabel -> {Style[\"[Vancomycin] (\\[Mu]M)\", 14, White], Style[\"Fraction folded\", 14, White]},\n  PlotRange -> {{0.8, cHi}, {0, 1}},\n  PlotRangePadding -> Scaled[0.04],\n  ImageSize -> 500, AspectRatio -> 0.75,\n  PlotLegends -> Placed[LineLegend[eCols, concElectrodes,\n    LabelStyle -> Directive[White, 12], Background -> darkBg,\n    LegendFunction -> (Framed[#, Background->darkBg, FrameStyle->fgStyle]&)], Right]\n]",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "db002241-c143-41ca-a03a-76a329d8bd1f"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### 5.5 Mean electron-transfer rate per state\nGeometric, g-weighted mean rate <k> of the unfolded (slow, range 1) and folded (fast, range 2) populations vs [vancomycin]. One faint curve per electrode; bold = pooled mean over electrodes. Uses the same kPeakRanges windows as the fraction-folded analysis.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* 5.5  Mean electron-transfer rate of each conformational state vs [vancomycin].\n   Each g(k) splits into the unfolded (slow) and folded (fast) populations using the\n   same kPeakRanges windows as the fraction-folded analysis (range 1 = unfolded,\n   range 2 = folded; see analysis/Biophysics.wl). We report the g-weighted GEOMETRIC\n   mean rate <k> of each population (centroid in log-k), one faint curve per electrode\n   plus the pooled mean over electrodes (bold). *)\n\nwindowGeoMean[spec_, kLo_, kHi_] := Module[{tau, g, k, logk, idx, w},\n  tau = spec[\"Tau\"]; g = spec[\"g\"]; k = 1./tau; logk = Log10[k];\n  idx = Select[Range[Length[g]], k[[#]] >= kLo && k[[#]] <= kHi && g[[#]] > 0 &];\n  If[idx === {}, Missing[], w = g[[idx]]; 10.^(w.logk[[idx]]/Total[w])]\n];\n\n(* {conc, <k>_unfolded, <k>_folded} per electrode, sorted by concentration *)\nstateRateData = Table[\n  Module[{subs},\n    subs = Select[concGoodSpecs, StringStartsQ[#File, e] &];\n    SortBy[{N@getLabelUM[#File],\n            windowGeoMean[#Spec, kPeakRanges[[1,1]], kPeakRanges[[1,2]]],\n            windowGeoMean[#Spec, kPeakRanges[[2,1]], kPeakRanges[[2,2]]]} & /@ subs, First]\n  ],\n  {e, concElectrodes}\n];\n\nstateXOf[c_] := If[c == 0, 0.3, N[c]];   (* 0 \\[Mu]M baseline at the left of the log axis *)\nfaintU = ({stateXOf[#[[1]]], #[[2]]} & /@ #) & /@ stateRateData;\nfaintF = ({stateXOf[#[[1]]], #[[3]]} & /@ #) & /@ stateRateData;\nbyC    = GroupBy[Flatten[stateRateData, 1], First];\nconcsS = Sort[Keys[byC]];\nboldU  = {stateXOf[#], Mean[DeleteMissing[byC[#][[All, 2]]]]} & /@ concsS;\nboldF  = {stateXOf[#], Mean[DeleteMissing[byC[#][[All, 3]]]]} & /@ concsS;\n\ncolU = ColorData[\"Rainbow\"][0.08]; colF = ColorData[\"Rainbow\"][0.85];\nnE = Length[concElectrodes];\n\n(* theme-parameterised so the dark notebook view and the white export share one definition *)\nstateRatesPlot[fg_, bg_] := Module[{xt},\n  xt = Join[\n    {{0.3, \"0\", {0, 0.016}, {fg}}},\n    {#, Superscript[10, Round@Log10[#]], {0, 0.016}, {fg}} & /@ {1., 10., 100., 1000.},\n    {#, \"\", {0, 0.008}, {fg}} & /@ Flatten@Table[m 10.^ee, {ee, 0, 2}, {m, {2, 3, 5, 7}}]];\n  ListLogLogPlot[\n    Join[faintU, faintF, {boldU, boldF}],\n    Joined -> True,\n    PlotStyle -> Join[\n      ConstantArray[Directive[colU, Opacity[0.3], AbsoluteThickness[1.]], nE],\n      ConstantArray[Directive[colF, Opacity[0.3], AbsoluteThickness[1.]], nE],\n      {Directive[colU, AbsoluteThickness[3.2]], Directive[colF, AbsoluteThickness[3.2]]}],\n    PlotMarkers -> Join[ConstantArray[{\"\\[FilledCircle]\", 4}, 2 nE],\n      {{\"\\[FilledCircle]\", 12}, {\"\\[FilledSquare]\", 11}}],\n    Frame -> True, Axes -> False, Background -> bg,\n    FrameStyle -> Directive[fg, AbsoluteThickness[1.2]], PlotTheme -> \"Default\",\n    LabelStyle -> Directive[fg, 13],\n    FrameTicks -> {{DCTPlots`ThemeLogTicks[30., 420., fg], None}, {xt, None}},\n    FrameTicksStyle -> Directive[fg, 12],\n    FrameLabel -> {Style[\"[Vancomycin] (\\[Mu]M)\", 14, fg],\n      Style[Row[{\"Mean electron-transfer rate, \\[LeftAngleBracket]k\\[RightAngleBracket] (\", Superscript[\"s\", -1], \")\"}], 14, fg]},\n    PlotRange -> {{0.22, 1600}, {28, 440}}, AspectRatio -> 0.62, ImageSize -> 680,\n    Epilog -> {Style[Text[\"Folded (fast)\", Scaled[{0.30, 0.9}]], colF, 14],\n      Style[Text[\"Unfolded (slow)\", Scaled[{0.30, 0.34}]], colU, 14]}]\n];\n\nstateRatesPlot[White, GrayLevel[0.12]]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"375116\" data-output-id=\"212\" data-out-n=\"1216\" data-sub-idx=\"15\" data-output-format=\"SVG\" data-output-is-graphics=\"1\" data-cell-idx=\"72\" data-sub-start=\"62\" data-sub-end=\"62\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[1216]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><span class=\"vscode-wolfram-gfx-marker\" style=\"display:none;\"></span><img class=\"vscode-wolfram-svg-output\" data-wl-img=\"c:\\Users\\bobla\\Documents\\DCT\\img\\EAB_DCT_analysis\\wl_vajc6u29tova.svg\" src=\"img/EAB_DCT_analysis/wl_vajc6u29tova.svg\"/></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "(* output: graphics *)\n(* 5.5  Mean electron-transfer rate of each conformational state vs [vancomycin].\n   Each g(k) splits into the unfolded (slow) and folded (fast) populations using the\n   same kPeakRanges windows as the fraction-folded analysis (range 1 = unfolded,\n   range 2 = folded; see analysis/Biophysics.wl). We report the g-weighted GEOMETRIC\n   mean rate <k> of each population (centroid in log-k), one faint curve per electrode\n   plus the pooled mean over electrodes (bold). *)\n\nwindowGeoMean[spec_, kLo_, kHi_] := Module[{tau, g, k, logk, idx, w},\n  tau = spec[\"Tau\"]; g = spec[\"g\"]; k = 1./tau; logk = Log10[k];\n  idx = Select[Range[Length[g]], k[[#]] >= kLo && k[[#]] <= kHi && g[[#]] > 0 &];\n  If[idx === {}, Missing[], w = g[[idx]]; 10.^(w.logk[[idx]]/Total[w])]\n];\n\n(* {conc, <k>_unfolded, <k>_folded} per electrode, sorted by concentration *)\nstateRateData = Table[\n  Module[{subs},\n    subs = Select[concGoodSpecs, StringStartsQ[#File, e] &];\n    SortBy[{N@getLabelUM[#File],\n            windowGeoMean[#Spec, kPeakRanges[[1,1]], kPeakRanges[[1,2]]],\n            windowGeoMean[#Spec, kPeakRanges[[2,1]], kPeakRanges[[2,2]]]} & /@ subs, First]\n  ],\n  {e, concElectrodes}\n];\n\nstateXOf[c_] := If[c == 0, 0.3, N[c]];   (* 0 \\[Mu]M baseline at the left of the log axis *)\nfaintU = ({stateXOf[#[[1]]], #[[2]]} & /@ #) & /@ stateRateData;\nfaintF = ({stateXOf[#[[1]]], #[[3]]} & /@ #) & /@ stateRateData;\nbyC    = GroupBy[Flatten[stateRateData, 1], First];\nconcsS = Sort[Keys[byC]];\nboldU  = {stateXOf[#], Mean[DeleteMissing[byC[#][[All, 2]]]]} & /@ concsS;\nboldF  = {stateXOf[#], Mean[DeleteMissing[byC[#][[All, 3]]]]} & /@ concsS;\n\ncolU = ColorData[\"Rainbow\"][0.08]; colF = ColorData[\"Rainbow\"][0.85];\nnE = Length[concElectrodes];\n\n(* theme-parameterised so the dark notebook view and the white export share one definition *)\nstateRatesPlot[fg_, bg_] := Module[{xt},\n  xt = Join[\n    {{0.3, \"0\", {0, 0.016}, {fg}}},\n    {#, Superscript[10, Round@Log10[#]], {0, 0.016}, {fg}} & /@ {1., 10., 100., 1000.},\n    {#, \"\", {0, 0.008}, {fg}} & /@ Flatten@Table[m 10.^ee, {ee, 0, 2}, {m, {2, 3, 5, 7}}]];\n  ListLogLogPlot[\n    Join[faintU, faintF, {boldU, boldF}],\n    Joined -> True,\n    PlotStyle -> Join[\n      ConstantArray[Directive[colU, Opacity[0.3], AbsoluteThickness[1.]], nE],\n      ConstantArray[Directive[colF, Opacity[0.3], AbsoluteThickness[1.]], nE],\n      {Directive[colU, AbsoluteThickness[3.2]], Directive[colF, AbsoluteThickness[3.2]]}],\n    PlotMarkers -> Join[ConstantArray[{\"\\[FilledCircle]\", 4}, 2 nE],\n      {{\"\\[FilledCircle]\", 12}, {\"\\[FilledSquare]\", 11}}],\n    Frame -> True, Axes -> False, Background -> bg,\n    FrameStyle -> Directive[fg, AbsoluteThickness[1.2]], PlotTheme -> \"Default\",\n    LabelStyle -> Directive[fg, 13],\n    FrameTicks -> {{DCTPlots`ThemeLogTicks[30., 420., fg], None}, {xt, None}},\n    FrameTicksStyle -> Directive[fg, 12],\n    FrameLabel -> {Style[\"[Vancomycin] (\\[Mu]M)\", 14, fg],\n      Style[Row[{\"Mean electron-transfer rate, \\[LeftAngleBracket]k\\[RightAngleBracket] (\", Superscript[\"s\", -1], \")\"}], 14, fg]},\n    PlotRange -> {{0.22, 1600}, {28, 440}}, AspectRatio -> 0.62, ImageSize -> 680,\n    Epilog -> {Style[Text[\"Folded (fast)\", Scaled[{0.30, 0.9}]], colF, 14],\n      Style[Text[\"Unfolded (slow)\", Scaled[{0.30, 0.34}]], colU, 14]}]\n];\n\nstateRatesPlot[White, GrayLevel[0.12]]",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "ae4f1a39-6f13-49f1-a078-7d9bd56a9405"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### 5a. Biophysical Model Fits\n\nFits the mechanistic kinetic model to fraction-folded vs concentration data pooled across all electrodes.\n\n**3-state model** (U ↔ F ↔ B): all aptamers can fold. Parameters: K_S (structural switching equilibrium), K_D (ligand dissociation constant). Baseline ff at zero ligand is K_S / (1 + K_S).\n\n**4-state model** (U ↔ F ↔ B + NF non-folding): fraction NF is permanently unfolded regardless of ligand. Parameters: K_S, K_D, NF. The 4-state K_D is typically much smaller than the 3-state K_D because NF absorbs the saturation shortfall rather than inflating K_D.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "### 5a.1 Fit and log-linear plot",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* Biophysical model fits using the mechanistic 3-state and 4-state kinetic models.\n   Data: {conc \\[Mu]M, ff} across all electrodes, positive concentrations only. *)\n\n(* --- model equations --- *)\nPrint[Style[\"3-state model  (U \\[LeftRightArrow] F \\[LeftRightArrow] B)\", Bold, 13]];\nPrint[Row[{\"  \", Subscript[\"f\",\"f\"], \" = \", DCTBiophysics`$FF3State}]];\nPrint[Style[\"4-state model  (U \\[LeftRightArrow] F \\[LeftRightArrow] B,  NF non-folding)\", Bold, 13]];\nPrint[Row[{\"  \", Subscript[\"f\",\"f\"], \" = \", DCTBiophysics`$FF4State}]];\nPrint[\"\"];\n\nallPts = Flatten[ffPos, 1];   (* all electrodes, conc > 0 *)\n\nfitResult = DCTBiophysics`FitFoldedFraction[allPts];\n\n(* --- fit parameters --- *)\nModule[{p3 = fitResult[\"Model3\"], p4 = fitResult[\"Model4\"]},\n  Print[Style[\"3-state model\", Bold, 13]];\n  Print[Row[{\"  \", Subscript[\"K\",\"S\"], \" = \", NumberForm[p3[\"KS\"], {4,3}],\n             \"     \", Subscript[\"K\",\"D\"], \" = \", NumberForm[p3[\"KD\"], {6,1}], \" \\[Mu]M\"}]];\n  Print[Style[\"4-state model\", Bold, 13]];\n  Print[Row[{\"  \", Subscript[\"K\",\"S\"], \" = \", NumberForm[p4[\"KS\"], {4,3}],\n             \"     \", Subscript[\"K\",\"D\"], \" = \", NumberForm[p4[\"KD\"], {6,1}], \" \\[Mu]M\",\n             \"     NF = \", NumberForm[p4[\"NF\"], {3,2}]}]]\n];\n\n(* --- plot --- *)\nModule[{ks3, kd3, ks4, kd4, nf4, m3, m4, tMin, tMax, c3pts, c4pts,\n        darkBg, fgStyle, eCols, modelStyles},\n  ks3 = fitResult[\"Model3\", \"KS\"];  kd3 = fitResult[\"Model3\", \"KD\"];\n  ks4 = fitResult[\"Model4\", \"KS\"];  kd4 = fitResult[\"Model4\", \"KD\"];\n  nf4 = fitResult[\"Model4\", \"NF\"];\n  m3 = DCTBiophysics`$FF3State /. {DCTBiophysics`KS -> ks3, DCTBiophysics`KD -> kd3};\n  m4 = DCTBiophysics`$FF4State /. {DCTBiophysics`KS -> ks4, DCTBiophysics`KD -> kd4, DCTBiophysics`NF -> nf4};\n\n  tMin = Log10[Min[allPts[[All,1]]] * 0.4];\n  tMax = Log10[Max[allPts[[All,1]]] * 3.];\n  c3pts = Table[{10^t, N[m3 /. DCTBiophysics`conc -> 10^t]}, {t, tMin, tMax, (tMax-tMin)/200}];\n  c4pts = Table[{10^t, N[m4 /. DCTBiophysics`conc -> 10^t]}, {t, tMin, tMax, (tMax-tMin)/200}];\n\n  darkBg     = GrayLevel[0.12];\n  fgStyle    = Directive[White, AbsoluteThickness[1.1]];\n  eCols      = Directive[ColorData[97][#], AbsoluteThickness[1.8], Opacity[0.65]] & /@ Range[Length[concElectrodes]];\n  modelStyles = {Directive[GrayLevel[0.65], Dashed, AbsoluteThickness[2.]], Directive[White, AbsoluteThickness[2.]]};\n\n  ListLinePlot[\n    Join[ffPos, {c3pts, c4pts}],\n    ScalingFunctions -> {\"Log10\", None},\n    (* data series = points only; the two model curves stay joined as lines *)\n    Joined -> Join[ConstantArray[False, Length[concElectrodes]], {True, True}],\n    PlotMarkers -> Join[ConstantArray[{Automatic, 10}, Length[concElectrodes]], {None, None}],\n    PlotStyle -> Join[eCols, modelStyles],\n    FrameTicks -> {{DCTPlots`ThemeLinTicks[0., 1., White], None}, {DCTPlots`ThemeLogTicks[0.8, cHi, White], None}},\n    FrameTicksStyle -> Directive[White, 12],\n    Frame -> True, Axes -> False, Background -> darkBg, FrameStyle -> fgStyle,\n    LabelStyle -> Directive[White, 14, FontFamily -> \"Arial\"],\n    FrameLabel -> {Style[\"[Vancomycin] (\\[Mu]M)\", 14, White], Style[\"Fraction folded\", 14, White]},\n    PlotRange -> {{0.8, cHi}, {0, 1}},\n    PlotRangePadding -> Scaled[0.04],\n    ImageSize -> 540, AspectRatio -> 0.75,\n    PlotLegends -> Placed[LineLegend[eCols, concElectrodes,\n      LabelStyle -> Directive[White, 12], Background -> darkBg,\n      LegendFunction -> (Framed[#, Background->darkBg, FrameStyle->fgStyle]&)], Right],\n    Epilog -> {\n      {Directive[GrayLevel[0.65], Dashed, AbsoluteThickness[2.]], Line[{Scaled[{0.58, 0.91}], Scaled[{0.67, 0.91}]}]},\n      Text[Style[\"3-state model\", GrayLevel[0.65], 11, FontFamily -> \"Arial\"], Scaled[{0.79, 0.91}]],\n      {Directive[White, AbsoluteThickness[2.]], Line[{Scaled[{0.58, 0.83}], Scaled[{0.67, 0.83}]}]},\n      Text[Style[\"4-state model\", White, 11, FontFamily -> \"Arial\"], Scaled[{0.79, 0.83}]]\n    }\n  ]\n]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-print-output\"><div class=\"wl-print-line\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered wl-lb-pending\" data-lb-id=\"lb-mqwpjydl-g70y9pq\" data-page-width-em=\"35\" data-latex-b64=\"XG1hdGhiZntcdGV4dHszLXN0YXRlIG1vZGVsICAoVSAkXGxlZnRyaWdodGFycm93JCBGICRcbGVmdHJpZ2h0YXJyb3ckIEIpfX0=\" style=\"opacity:0.65;transition:opacity 0.35s\"><div class=\"wl-lb-content\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">3-state model (U </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">↔</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"> F </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">↔</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"> B)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
